# From the post of 2022-01-23 (studies/data/notes/post-know-where-you-are-going.html), in the author's words.

=== You can know
--- You can know where you are going [title]
overline: A post from the channel
heading: You can know where you are going
sub: The Bible says you can know, with certainty.
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move through the slides. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

--- You can know
lead: You want to know where you are going when your body dies, the Bible says you can know, with certainty.

--- All you need
lead: That believing on the perfect work of Jesus Christ as the sole sacrifice, the sole propitiation for our sins, accepting God's free gift of eternal life, is all you need.
p: That by doing so and trusting in Him, your dead spirit is quickened, your inner man awakened, becoming heir to the promise, a son of God. Whom Jesus is not ashamed to call brethren. Sealed unto judgement. Who no man may pluck from His hand.
p: That our faith is counted on for righteousness.

=== That ye may know
--- That ye may know [title]
heading: That ye may know
scripture: 1 John 5:13-15 | mark: that ye may know that ye have eternal life
